  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7ba04ae24abf83048b2750cab53bc4a1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Alpha v0.2.0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  versionName: Alpha v0.2.0
  logcontent: '<b><size=120%>Added:</size></b>

    <size=85%>- New Input System
    integration (PlayerInputActions) across all player mechanics and UI

    - Enemy
    cluster spawning system with on-screen warnings

    - Scaling enemy health and
    damage over time

    - On-screen floating damage numbers and hit indicator pool

    -
    Fast Enemy and Tank Enemy data configurations

    - Death screen logic and flow

    -
    Armor, Life Steal, and Experience Multiplier stats

    - Auto-fill shield on
    first unlock

    - Time freeze while selecting upgrades

    - Generic on-screen
    notification system</size>


    <b><size=120%>Changed:</size></b>

    <size=85%>-
    Release balance adjustments

    - Buffed orb pickup speed and attraction radius

    -
    Enemy spawner variable configuration logic

    - Merged walk and run speed into
    single movement speed stat</size>


    <b><size=120%>Fixed:</size></b>

    <size=85%>-
    Fixed enemy first attack timing bug

    - Fixed shield orb spawning before shield
    unlock

    - Fixed upgrade generator offering percentage upgrades on zero-value
    stats</size>


    <b><size=120%>Removed:</size></b>

    <size=85%>- Legacy
    Unity Input Manager polling

    - Crouch speed stat

    - Separate walk/run
    speed stats</size>'
